<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean coffee, effective Sept 19-25:</p>
<p>	  Washed arabic....................$100.87</p>
<p>	  Natural arabic...................$ 87.15</p>
<p>	  Robust natural...................$ 61.85</p>
<p>	  Roasted and/or ground............$ 88.66</p>
</text>
